    "overview": "Agenda and money printed in two spot inks on clean paper: turmeric for what is happening, sea teal for what you own, and the green they make where they overlap marks a bill. Each screen opens with a title tile named after its menu. Dark mode is a calm warm graphite with colour kept for meaning only.",
